    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/fcabf81d223fa39ba50a138b2d8da12c.avif?t=1755510942\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer says:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game emphasizes the beauty of combat and sex, inviting players to appreciate and savor the experience from an aesthetic perspective, delivering an unprecedented level of\u00a0 impact.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative &quot;Free-Look-Slow-Motion&quot; system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make players more immersed, we developed this &quot;free perspective slow motion&quot; system. Players can travel around the arena and observe it freely, enjoying every wonderful close-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/fa77cc64215438cd075561cea82282e3.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worldview Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the convergence of the Nine Realms known as the &quot;Midgard Rift,&quot; a war that shattered a thousand-year balance is raging. The Valkyries of Norse legend\u2014once Odin's chosen guides of fallen warriors\u2014now find themselves locked in a desperate battle against an infernal legion pouring forth from the abyss, as the prophecy of Ragnar\u00f6k manifests prematurely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leading this demonic onslaught is Loki Shadowflame, a fallen god who has stolen the roots of Yggdrasil, the World Tree, and infused the creatures of the underworld with forbidden chaos magic, transforming them into light-devouring &quot;Eclipseborn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you\u2014an unnamed champion summoned by the Valkyrie Queen Brynhildr with her dying divine power\u2014are the key to turning the tide of war\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will train with Valkyries:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/bb45b8159114ff5adab2a268576e1465.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will have sex with Valkyries:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/3ebd0ccc3ebbc2a8e836f56ec560edc7.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will fight with Valkyries, against devil girls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/28347ebe9572f1f3ded023bc15c946e6.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will punish devil girls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/7e9e53b1cff6cce6a839d8c0ec629a96.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock the Valkyries, train with them, fight with them, and have sex with them:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/2d0d5e33b6a51f92e953521e1e3fc17c.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/fcabf81d223fa39ba50a138b2d8da12c.avif?t=1755510942\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer says:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game emphasizes the beauty of combat and sex, inviting players to appreciate and savor the experience from an aesthetic perspective, delivering an unprecedented level of\u00a0 impact.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative &quot;Free-Look-Slow-Motion&quot; system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make players more immersed, we developed this &quot;free perspective slow motion&quot; system. Players can travel around the arena and observe it freely, enjoying every wonderful close-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/fa77cc64215438cd075561cea82282e3.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worldview Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the convergence of the Nine Realms known as the &quot;Midgard Rift,&quot; a war that shattered a thousand-year balance is raging. The Valkyries of Norse legend\u2014once Odin's chosen guides of fallen warriors\u2014now find themselves locked in a desperate battle against an infernal legion pouring forth from the abyss, as the prophecy of Ragnar\u00f6k manifests prematurely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leading this demonic onslaught is Loki Shadowflame, a fallen god who has stolen the roots of Yggdrasil, the World Tree, and infused the creatures of the underworld with forbidden chaos magic, transforming them into light-devouring &quot;Eclipseborn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you\u2014an unnamed champion summoned by the Valkyrie Queen Brynhildr with her dying divine power\u2014are the key to turning the tide of war\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will train with Valkyries:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/bb45b8159114ff5adab2a268576e1465.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will have sex with Valkyries:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/3ebd0ccc3ebbc2a8e836f56ec560edc7.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will fight with Valkyries, against devil girls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/28347ebe9572f1f3ded023bc15c946e6.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you will punish devil girls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/7e9e53b1cff6cce6a839d8c0ec629a96.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock the Valkyries, train with them, fight with them, and have sex with them:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/2d0d5e33b6a51f92e953521e1e3fc17c.avif?t=1755510942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"